Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: plurx-player
Comment: The launcher is part of plurx; see LICENSE and NOTICE at the
 repository root. The package also carries private builds of libplacebo
 and mpv, whose pinned upstream sources (packaging/upstream.lock) are the
 libplacebo and mpv components of this source package;
 /usr/share/doc/plurx-player/private-build.txt names the exact versions
 and patches.

Files: *
Copyright: 2026 plurx contributors
License: Apache-2.0

Files: libplacebo/*
Copyright: 2017-2026 Niklas Haas and the libplacebo contributors
License: LGPL-2.1+
Comment: libplacebo is linked statically into /usr/lib/plurx-player/bin/mpv,
 and it statically embeds glslang and
 SPIRV-Tools from the build environment (the package's Built-Using field
 names their exact versions). glslang is under BSD-3-clause, MIT,
 Apple-MIT-license and, for its Bison-generated parser, GPL-3 with the
 Bison exception; SPIRV-Tools is under Apache-2.0. Their full Debian
 copyright files are installed as
 /usr/share/doc/plurx-player/copyright.glslang and copyright.spirv-tools.

Files: mpv/*
Copyright: 2000-2025 the MPlayer, mplayer2 and mpv contributors
License: GPL-2+
Comment: mpv is built with -Dgpl=true and compiles plurx's Apache-2.0
 display management (dm/*), so /usr/lib/plurx-player/bin/mpv as a whole is
 distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later (mpv's GPL-2.0-or-later allows that, and
 Apache-2.0 is compatible with GPL-3.0). Some of its source files are also
 available under LGPL-2.1-or-later; see upstream's Copyright file.

Files: dm/*
Copyright: 2026 Paul Junod
License: Apache-2.0
Comment: plurx's closed-form Dolby Vision display management
 (tools/dv_processing in the plurx repository; see its LICENSE and NOTICE),
 compiled into the private mpv.

Files: packaging/libdovi/rpu_parser.h
Copyright: 2021-2026 quietvoid and the dovi_tool contributors
License: MIT
Comment: The libdovi C API header (dolby_vision 3.2.0), the copy plurx's
 processing helper pins. mpv links the distribution's libdovi.

Files: mpv/etc/mpv.metainfo.xml
Copyright: 2000-2025 the MPlayer, mplayer2 and mpv contributors
